 "name_en": "Set Up Configurable Model using Variant Configuration (22T)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Set Up Configurable Model using Variant Configuration (22T)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc9fbcc4582884f17ba9bb3e93bc41929\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9fbcc4582884f17ba9bb3e93bc41929__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Improve your company's product engineering, sales, and manufacturing performance with SAP software for integrated variant configuration and classification. Enable your business process to handle highly individualized products in sales and manufacturing.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">A comprehensive simulation environment supports state-of-the-art configuration, sophisticated analysis of your configurable products, and real-time integration to the configurable BOM Explosion. Get support from integrated requirements management.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9fbcc4582884f17ba9bb3e93bc41929__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create characteristics for class (to be used for variant configuration)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create class (to be used for variant configuration)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assign class to product</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create variant table</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain variant table content</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create configuration profile</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and assign grouping</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create constraint net</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and assign high-level dependencies</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create super BOM</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Add stock item</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Add class node item</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Add low level dependencies</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Simulate configurable BOM</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">2G4: Requirements driven development</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and assign high-level dependencies</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform simulation and root cause check</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9fbcc4582884f17ba9bb3e93bc41929__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce costs and optimize usability with sophisticated variant configuration</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase sales force efficiency by higher tool support within order configuration to allow the sales force to focus on selling</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase modeling efficiency for new configured product modeling by effective simulation of new product variants and options</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce time to market for new products by advanced variant configuration modeling and effective simulation of new product variants and options</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Establish efficient collaboration between requirements management and modeler</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用变式配置设置可配置模型 (22T)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc9fbcc4582884f17ba9bb3e93bc41929\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9fbcc4582884f17ba9bb3e93bc41929__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">借助 SAP 的集成式变式配置和分类软件，提高公司的产品工程、销售和制造绩效。使您的业务流程能够处理销售和制造中的高度个性化产品。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">全面的模拟环境支持最先进的配置、可配置产品的复杂分析以及与可配置物料清单展开的实时集成。从集成需求管理中获得支持。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9fbcc4582884f17ba9bb3e93bc41929__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建类的特征（用于变式配置）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建类（用于变式配置）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将类分配到产品</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建变式表</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">维护变式表内容</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建配置参数文件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建并分配分组</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建约束网</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建和分配高级相关性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建超级物料清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">添加库存项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">添加类节点项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">添加低级别相关性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">模拟可配置物料清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">2G4：需求驱动开发</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建和分配高级相关性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行模拟和根本原因检查</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9fbcc4582884f17ba9bb3e93bc41929__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过复杂的变式配置降低成本并优化可用性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过提高订单配置中的工具支持提高销售人员效率，使销售人员能够专注于销售</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过有效模拟新产品变式和选项，提高新配置产品建模的建模效率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过高级变式配置建模和新产品变式和选项的有效模拟，缩短新产品的上市时间</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在需求管理和建模器之间建立有效的协作</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
